        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Solid Brass 3-5/8 Inch Decorative Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese decorative solid brass door stops screw onto the baseboard casement or door bottom, to protect  the door hardware and wall.  Victorian styling and hand finished by the master craftsmen at First Impressions International, in your choice of high quality finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Not just for decoration!</b> These decorative door stops are heavy duty 3/4 inches in diameter to with stand even large solid wood doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Other \r\n<a href=\"/collections/decorative-door-stops\"><b>Decorative Door Stops by First Impressions</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions  SMR-1225 Decorative Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Screw Stud</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip: White</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
